{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And the land shall not be sold in perpetuity.</b> Cultivated land." "<b>For the land is Mine.</b> That region is the land of YHWH, for you are sojourners and settlers with Me — in that region which is not included in וְהָאָרֶץ נָתַן לִבְנֵי אָדָם (Psalms 115:16)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {1 "Reading הַגָּלִיל as 'that region/sphere' referring back to הָאָרֶץ in the verse; the sense is the specific land of Israel distinct from the earth given to humankind generally."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:59.640733168Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}